{
  "info": {
    "name": "Nightswatch (AI-SRE) \u2014 E2E flow",
    "description": "End-to-end walkthrough: admin bootstrap \u2192 tenant + first API key \u2192 Prometheus integration \u2192 subject service \u2192 fire a signed Alertmanager webhook \u2192 read the investigation/report/trace \u2192 feedback \u2192 knowledge \u2192 backtest/replay.\n\nSetup: set `base_url` and `admin_token` in the collection variables (and `prometheus_url` if you want selector validation + real queries to succeed). Then run the folders top to bottom \u2014 every id/key/secret the flow needs is captured into collection variables automatically, including the webhook HMAC signature (computed in a pre-request script).\n\nSlack OAuth is a browser redirect flow and can't run inside Postman \u2014 open {{base_url}}/v1/integrations/slack/oauth/start in a browser with a Bearer header (or via the dashboard) to connect Slack.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
